Fixture C (M6 spec 17): an ARC that CROSSES 0 degrees -- start 350, end 40.
999
DXF arcs always sweep counter-clockwise from start to end, so this one is a
999
50 degree sweep through 0, not a 310 degree sweep the other way. An importer
999
that assumed end > start would get the sweep backwards, and an arc that does
999
not cross zero cannot reveal that.
